{"body_markdown":"","change_reason":"2026-09-17完整审阅后同步独立上下文记录的新修订与文稿衔接；原实验数字和科学状态不变。","content_hash":"e9dad4be5c188000fc40aa063de299c74a05779f4a7ed040edad80b32d1a823d","created_at":"2026-09-09T06:32:34.154111Z","created_by":{"id":"codex-approved-v3-report-author","kind":"ai"},"discovery":"workspace_summary","keywords":["浮点求和","顺序敏感","补偿","有限构造输入"],"kind":"document_section","level":null,"owner_id":"RES-FLOATING-POINT-SUMMATION","payload":{"blocks":[{"evidence_refs":[{"locator":"完整正文与固定依据","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"ba12342c6ca8afa0a1760dc517fd7bff2d1b60c7f082ee9113e419572834df51","target_id":"MEM-4acc73bb-59c7-560d-9415-fd42e9dcaa2d","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"完整正文与固定依据","relation":"references","revision":4,"sha256":"057444c965f88537bd84bd1fa15d550dc460e0f2bdc213255ddddf5e71f29a2c","target_id":"MEM-c52df8fb-ca9e-53a7-a49b-342592884a50","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"完整正文与固定依据","relation":"references","revision":4,"sha256":"8a426e60c38f34decb51da95cf778b05678416e166f0b715c1d5347ccf5b3188","target_id":"MEM-c4a61c00-1bf1-59b3-a65e-0fa4847db2e1","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"完整正文与固定依据","relation":"references","revision":4,"sha256":"41e071e700ec9ddf3a7e779a5180d1794addcee82af21a25c6a0342dbca8e350","target_id":"MEM-96f79923-f023-509e-a002-40f2d5a4fca1","target_kind":"record"}],"markdown":"| 构造场景 | 显式逐项累加 | Kahan | Neumaier | math.fsum |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| 第一轮：3种顺序 | 1/3 | 未比较 | 未比较 | 3/3 |\n| 第二轮：三项输入全部6种排列 | 2/6 | 2/6 | 6/6 | 6/6 |\n| 第三轮：30项输入的30种排列 | 0/30 | 5/30 | 30/30 | 30/30 |\n\n表中为精确命中数/已测试样本数。逐项累加的最大绝对误差在三轮分别为1000、1和10；Kahan在第二、三轮均出现误差，最大值分别为1和10。Neumaier及math.fsum在其对应已测试输入中均与精确基准一致。\n\n第二轮$[10^{16},1,-10^{16}]$的Kahan轨迹表明：第二步补偿值已记录为$-1$，但第三步修正输入时再次舍入，最终返回0而精确和为1。因此，问题并非“补偿没有发生”，而是这个具体实现与输入中补偿仍可能丢失。该反例也不能推出Kahan在所有场景无效。","type":"prose"}],"missing_refs":[],"role":"experiment","section_key":"brief-results","title":"核心结果","watch_refs":[{"baseline_record_hash":"ba12342c6ca8afa0a1760dc517fd7bff2d1b60c7f082ee9113e4195728